{"availability":"available","full":"AllanChain/sane-break","name":"sane-break","description":"Gentle break reminder that helps you avoid mindlessly skipping breaks","category":"Other","language":"C++","stars":102,"forks":13,"created":"2024-06-15T10:51:26Z","updated":"2026-10-06T00:05:38Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://allanchain.github.io/sane-break/","topics":["break","qt6","reminder","rsi"],"demo":"https://allanchain.github.io/sane-break/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T16:53:16.984Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T16:53:16.984Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T16:53:16.984Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:54:10.692Z","stars":101,"forks":13},{"at":"2026-10-09T08:56:03.012Z","stars":102,"forks":13},{"at":"2026-10-12T09:43:08.770Z","stars":101,"forks":13},{"at":"2026-10-18T16:53:16.984Z","stars":102,"forks":13}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Sane Break is a cross-platform break reminder designed to help you take meaningful breaks without disrupting your workflow.","Most break reminder apps send notifications before the break is scheduled, but that merely informs me that a break is going to happen, rather than telling me it's happening right now. Even with a warning, when the break actually happens I'm too often deeply focused on a task. Then, the program either forces the break, interrupting my work, or I can use a \"skip\" or \"postpone\" button. Accepting abrupt interruption is too harsh, so I tend to click \"skip\" or \"postpone\". Then, that becomes an almost instinctive habit, and before I know it, hours have passed without a single break.","In contrast, Sane Break allows me to take ownership of when to stop and break. It starts by providing a gentle, non-intrusive reminder through a flashing window. The break officially begins as soon as I naturally pause after finishing my current task. This way, Sane Break offers the flexibility to wrap up my work and take a break on my terms, rather than forcing an abrupt interruption."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AllanChain/sane-break/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"336538f3f46bbbfc1881f88130be7ee85cf5908ded04f405decb27c54e57c66a","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:11.000Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T02:50:49.675Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Sane Break is a cross-platform break reminder designed to help you take meaningful breaks without disrupting your workflow.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AllanChain/sane-break/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"You may need to logout and login from the Wayland session to make the extension work.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AllanChain/sane-break/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"336538f3f46bbbfc1881f88130be7ee85cf5908ded04f405decb27c54e57c66a","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AllanChain/sane-break/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T02:50:49.675Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T00:05:38Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/AllanChain/sane-break/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-19T02:50:49.676Z","hash":"336538f3f46bbbfc1881f88130be7ee85cf5908ded04f405decb27c54e57c66a","originalBytes":12229,"storedBytes":12229,"truncated":false},"lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:54:10.692Z","subjects":[],"platforms":[],"classification":{"version":4,"method":"local_rules","category":"Other","subjects":[],"evidence":[],"platformEvidence":[],"platformSupport":"author_metadata_not_runtime_tested","suggestedSubjects":["Automation & workflows","Apple"],"reviewRequired":true},"demoHealth":{"url":"https://allanchain.github.io/sane-break/","attemptedAt":"2026-10-14T13:47:27.574Z","probeVersion":3,"status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-14T13:47:27.574Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-14T13:47:27.574Z","target":"https://allanchain.github.io/sane-break/","failureCount":0,"consecutiveTemporaryFailure